column5:
The issue describes a problem with the line endings generated by the 'ant javacc' command on Windows/Cygwin, indicating that it produces incorrect line endings ( or 
 instead of 
). The user has provided a workaround and has also modified the build.xml task to fix this issue for the QueryParser. This clearly indicates that there is a malfunction in the software's behavior regarding line endings, which is characteristic of a bug. Therefore, the appropriate label for this issue is 'bug'.
